OSI & TCP/IP Models (Very Short)

OSI Model (7 Layers):

Application: HTTP (web browsing)

Presentation: SSL/TLS (encryption)

Session: User login session

Transport: TCP (reliable data)

Network: IP (routing)

Data Link: Ethernet, MAC address

Physical: Cable, Wi-Fi

TCP/IP Model (4 Layers):

Application: HTTP, FTP

Transport: TCP, UDP

Internet: IP

Network Access: Ethernet, Wi-Fi